{
  "rationale": "The plant models robot sensing and actuation, separating perception (uncontrollable events) from motion (controllable events). The specification enforces safe, coverage-oriented exploration: move forward or random_walk when clear, recover with short turns or brief backward escape on obstacles, and use full_rotate only after repeated failures. All obstacle recovery is conservative and returns to exploration as soon as possible.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate plant automata for perception and motion: G1 for perception, G2 for motion.",
    "Specification E1 encodes safe, coverage-biased exploration: forward/random_walk in clear, short turns for side obstacles, backward+turn for front obstacles, and full_rotate only after repeated failures."
  ],
